## Model card

- **Name:** Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 30B A3B (Reasoning)
- **Short description:** NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Nano Omni is an open omni-modal reasoning model (31B/3B-active class) supporting text, image, video, and audio input with text output and a free Build endpoint.
- **Provider / access:** NVIDIA Build, Hugging Face/open ecosystem, and hosted providers. Local metadata lists `nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning`, $0 on Build/OpenRouter free route, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** NVIDIA Build model page reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed source.
- **IDs:** `nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning`, `Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 30B A3B`.
- **Context window:** 256,000–262,144 tokens (local metadata notes both); 65,536 max output.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, and audio input; text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0 on NVIDIA Build and OpenRouter free route; paid ~$0.20/$0.80 on some providers (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Omni-modal reasoning model (Nano family). Detailed parameter/architecture breakdown not fully specified in reviewed Build page text.

